                <pb facs="0619" n="507" xml:id="pg507"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Bliss to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-12-28"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 28,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The President returned last night; approves your December 19. Argentine minister
                    for foreign affairs is instructing Argentine minister at Lima to act with
                    representatives of the United States and Brazil in accordance with your December
                    22, to Petropolis, and at the same time to telegraph minister for foreign
                    affairs of Ecuador in a like sense.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bliss.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
